Z||000000||88formula||07-21-2000||06:18 PM||||Raced my brothers 87 coupe with my 89 Bonneville in the parking lot of my gym. We were dead even up to 60 mph and then I started to pull away slowly above that. My Bonneville has a 165 hp 3.8-liter engine in a 3300 lb. car. My brother’s coupe has a ported head and ceramic coated manifold on the Iron Duke. <P>Not much of a race but it was fun and I thought I would tell everyone what happened. I thought I would beat him better than that. <P>I would put this post in the general chat but I can't delete this one. Don't matter!<p>[This message has been edited by 88formula (edited 07-21-2000).]||||reg||1
